---
import BaseLayout from '@versal/ui/BaseLayout';
---

<BaseLayout
  site="main"
  title="Licenses & Third-Party Notices"
  description="Font, library and infrastructure attributions for jsonversal.com — including our self-hosted Geist fonts, the third-party code we ship, and our advertising partner."
  canonical="https://jsonversal.com/licenses/"
>
  <h1>Licenses &amp; Third-Party Notices</h1>
  <p class="text-muted">Last updated: 2026-10-10</p>

  <p class="lead">
    This page lists every font, library and service the site relies on, together with
    its license and where to find the full license text. jsonversal's own assets are
    self-hosted; the only third party that receives a request at runtime is our
    advertising partner, described below.
  </p>

  <h2>Fonts</h2>
  <p>
    This site uses <strong>Geist</strong> and <strong>Geist Mono</strong>, served from this
    domain. The font files are self-hosted — the page does not contact Google Fonts,
    Adobe Fonts, Bunny Fonts or any other font CDN.
  </p>

  <table class="lic-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Asset</th><th>Copyright</th><th>License</th><th>Full text</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Geist · Geist Mono</td>
        <td>© 2023 Vercel, in collaboration with basement.studio</td>
        <td>SIL Open Font License 1.1</td>
        <td><a href="/fonts/LICENSE-Geist-OFL.txt">LICENSE-Geist-OFL.txt</a></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p class="text-muted">
    The SIL OFL 1.1 permits commercial use, self-hosting, web embedding and redistribution.
    It requires that this copyright notice and the license text accompany the fonts, and
    prohibits selling the fonts on their own.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party code</h2>
  <p>
    Every library below is bundled or self-hosted and served from this origin. None of them
    is fetched from a public CDN at runtime.
  </p>

  <table class="lic-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Component</th><th>Version</th><th>Copyright</th><th>License</th><th>Full text</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>yaml</td>
        <td>2.5.0</td>
        <td>© Eemeli Aro</td>
        <td>ISC</td>
        <td><a href="/vendor/LICENSE-yaml.txt">LICENSE-yaml.txt</a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>bcryptjs</td>
        <td>^3.0.3</td>
        <td>© Daniel Wirtz</td>
        <td>MIT</td>
        <td><span class="text-muted">see package</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Astro</td>
        <td>4.x</td>
        <td>© Astro contributors</td>
        <td>MIT</td>
        <td><span class="text-muted">build-time only</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Infrastructure and advertising</h2>
  <table class="lic-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Service</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Data involved</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Cloudflare Pages</td>
        <td>Hosting and content delivery</td>
        <td>Connection metadata (IP) processed to serve the request</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Google AdSense</td>
        <td>Advertising — funds the free tools</td>
        <td>
          IP address, page URL, device and browser, and coarse location inferred
          from IP, used by Google and its partners to serve and measure ads.
          Never your tool input.
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p class="text-muted">
    Cloudflare acts as our hosting provider and Google AdSense as our advertising partner.
    Ad serving is subject to Google's own privacy policies and to the opt-out links in the
    <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>. We do not receive your name, email address, or
    the contents of anything you enter into a tool.
  </p>

  <h2>What this site does and does not send</h2>
  <ul class="note-list">
    <li>No external font CDN — fonts are served from this domain.</li>
    <li>No third-party JavaScript CDN — libraries are bundled or self-hosted.</li>
    <li>No analytics beacon of our own — the site runs no first-party analytics.</li>
    <li>No social widgets and no embedded third-party media.</li>
    <li>Advertising is served by Google AdSense; see the table above for exactly what that involves.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="text-muted">
    This matters beyond performance: loading an asset from a third-party CDN discloses the
    visitor's IP address to that provider. Under the GDPR that is a personal-data transfer
    requiring a legal basis — which is why we keep our own assets self-hosted and limit
    third-party contact to the advertising we disclose. The tools themselves run entirely
    in your browser, so the data you paste never leaves your device and is never sent to us,
    to Google, or to any ad partner.
  </p>

  <h2>Reporting an attribution problem</h2>
  <p>
    If you believe your work is used here without proper attribution, please write to
    <a href="mailto:hello@jsonversal.com">hello@jsonversal.com</a> and we will correct it promptly.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lic-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin: 16px 0 24px;
    font-size: .9rem;
  }
  .lic-table th,
  .lic-table td {
    text-align: left;
    vertical-align: top;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .lic-table th {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: .78rem;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  }
  .lic-table td:first-child { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .lic-table td { color: var(--text-muted); }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .lic-table { display: block; overflow-x: auto; white-space: nowrap; }
  }
</style>
